record_type_quote:
This current investigation replicates and extends Wei et al. (
2024
) using the same reading materials and pre-reading prompts (integrative prompts vs. detailed prompts), with different but related extra-textual strategies intended to leverage the findings for concept maps, including a pre-reading expert integrative network vs. intra-text network (Study 1) and post-reading network-based writing feedback (Study 2).

